> Silver Play (silverplay.in) is an Indian online jewellery brand selling handcrafted 925 sterling silver earrings and pendants set with natural gemstones. Every piece is made by hand by karigars in its Jaipur atelier and shipped across India and worldwide.

## Product

Silver Play makes 92.5% sterling silver jewellery, hand-set with natural, individually selected stones such as Blue Opal, Tiger Eye, Rose Quartz, Pyrite, Dragon Blood Jasper, Amazonite and Mother of Pearl. Because each stone is natural, no two pieces are identical. The catalogue covers 220+ products, mainly earrings (studs, jhumkas, hoops, balis, drops, statement) and pendants (gemstone, spiritual and men's), priced from about ₹1,399 to ₹34,999. Designed for women and men who want meaningful, everyday-wearable or heirloom-quality silver, and for gifting.

## Key Features

- 925 sterling silver (92.5% pure silver alloyed with copper), BIS hallmarked, hypoallergenic
- Handcrafted by karigars in Jaipur; natural, hand-selected gemstones
- Intention-based gemstone edits: Lakshmi Ratna (wealth), Mann Shanti (calm), Shakti Kavach (protection), Prem Moh (love), Nayi Shuruaat (new beginnings), Sankalp Shakti (willpower), Sankat Mochan Ratna (problem solving)
- Gen-Z Edit: everyday silver under ₹4,000
- Festive, Rakhi, Navratri, Ganpati and wedding collections
- Detailed stone guides for 25+ gemstones (origin, meaning, care)
- Free shipping on all prepaid orders within India; international shipping available
- Prepaid only (no Cash on Delivery)
- Custom and wholesale orders accepted on request

